# .npmrc — pnpm v11 authentication and registry settings
#
# NOTE: In pnpm v11, general settings (hoisting, build scripts, peer deps, etc.)
# are configured in pnpm-workspace.yaml rather than .npmrc.
# Only authentication tokens and registry URLs belong here.
#
# See: https://pnpm.io/settings
# Auth and registry settings only (pnpm v11+)
# Other settings are in pnpm-workspace.yaml
